PASS  DecisionTree(depth 4) gains NOTHING from column-permutation views   | the permuted tree IS the same tree — no diversity to average
  RandomForest(30)       1 view 3.6151 -> 16 views 3.6230  (-0.22%)
PASS  RandomForest(30) gains NOTHING from column-permutation views   | the permuted tree IS the same tree — no diversity to average

ADOPTION RULE: column-shuffle TTA is worthless for order-invariant learners (trees, GBMs).
It needs a predictor whose output depends on column order — the next cell shows TabFM is one.
